{"slug": "hp", "name": "HP", "category": "Media & Consumer Tech", "summary": "PC and printer maker. Pure white canvas, HP Electric Blue signal CTA, geometric Forma DJR Micro, blue chevron decorations", "description": "An inspired interpretation of HP's design language — a white-paper enterprise-consumer system anchored by HP Electric Blue (`#024ad8`) as the lone signal CTA, near-black ink (`#1a1a1a`) for headlines, geometric Forma-DJR sans throughout, and angular blue-chevron decorations that nod to the HP wordmark's slashes. Cards round at 8–16px, photos sit in soft 16px frames, and dark navy slabs anchor the customer-story and \"how can we help\" closing bands.", "colors": [{"name": "HP Electric Blue", "hex": "#024ad8", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "primary", "role": "the system's lone signal — primary CTA fill, link color, chevron-decoration fill, active sub-nav indicator. Reserved."}, {"name": "Bright Blue", "hex": "#296ef9", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "primary-bright", "role": "a slightly lighter variant used inside dark slabs (testimonial-card buttons, dark-band CTA links) where the deeper blue would muddy."}, {"name": "Deep Navy", "hex": "#0e3191", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "primary-deep", "role": "pressed state for the primary CTA and the visited-link color."}, {"name": "Soft Blue", "hex": "#c9e0fc", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "primary-soft", "role": "pale-blue surface used inside customer-story cards and selection chips."}, {"name": "Canvas", "hex": "#ffffff", "group": "Surface", "token": "canvas", "role": "the universal page background. White, full opacity."}, {"name": "Paper", "hex": "#ffffff", "group": "Surface", "token": "paper", "role": "card surfaces — same white as canvas, with hairline borders or shadows providing the lift."}, {"name": "Cloud", "hex": "#f7f7f7", "group": "Surface", "token": "cloud", "role": "the lightest gray section band, used for alternating-row backgrounds and product-feature card groups."}, {"n